.TH "nvme_init_fabric_zoning_send" 9 "nvme_init_fabric_zoning_send" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_fabric_zoning_send \- Initialize passthru command for Fabric Zoning Send
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_fabric_zoning_send
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u32 zdk "  ","
.BI "__u32 zdo "  ","
.BI "bool lf "  ","
.BI "bool zdkc "  ","
.BI "__u32 numd "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "zdk" 12
Zoning Data Key (ZDK), or Transaction ID if \fIzdkc\fP is set
.IP "zdo" 12
Zoning Data Offset (ZDO)
.IP "lf" 12
Last Fragment (LF): set if \fIdata\fP contains the last fragment
of the Zoning data structure
.IP "zdkc" 12
ZDK Context (ZDKC): if set, \fIzdk\fP contains a Transaction ID
instead of a Zoning Data Key
.IP "numd" 12
Number of Dwords (NUMD) to transfer
.IP "data" 12
Zoning data buffer
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Fabric Zoning Send
command.
